证金缴纳截止时间：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><u><span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span></span></u><u><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span></u><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><u><span><span><span><span><span>07</span></span></span></span></span></u><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><u><span><span><span><span><span>09</span></span></span></span></span></u><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><u><span><span><span><span><span>09</span></span></span></span></span></u><span><span><span>时</span></span></span><u><span><span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span></span></span></u><span><span><span>分</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><u><span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span></span></u><u><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span></u><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><u><span><span><span><span><span>07</span></span></span></span></span></u><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><u><span><span><span><span><span>15</span></span></span></span></span></u><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><u><span><span><span><span><span>09</span></span></span></span></span></u><span><span><span>时</span></span></span><u><span><span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span></span></span></u><span><span><span>分</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>招标文件投标人须知前附表</span></span><span><span>1.4.1</span></span><span><span>“投标人资质条</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>件、能力和信誉”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>九、其他要求:</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.委托代理人须提供授权委托书:且为独立投标人(或联合体牵头人)正式员工(提供投标截止时前3个月连续缴纳社保的材料(证明材料应带有二维码标识):企业设立不足3个月的，从设立时起):</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>☑</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>不要求造价人员:</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>口要求造价人员具备(等级)造价工程师(水利工程)注册证且在投标单位有效注册:</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.其他:。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>九、其他要求:</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.投标人法定代表人须具备水利行政主管部门核发的有效《水利水电工程施工企业主要负责人安全生产考核合格证书》:</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>.委托代理人须提供授权委托书:且为独立投标人(或联合体牵头人)正式员工(提供投标截止时前3个月连续缴纳社保的材料(证明材料应带有二维码标识):企业设立不足3个月的，从设立时起):</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>☑</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>不要求造价人员:</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>口要求造价人员具备(等级)造价工程师(水利工程)注册证且在投标单位有效注册:</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>.其他:。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>招标文件投标人须知前附表</span></span><span><span>10.11</span></span><span><span>其他要求</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.投标人须承诺具备完成本项目的履约能力，在规定的工期内保质、保量的完成该项目所有工作，施工的内容以招标人下达的任务书为准。</span></span></span></span><b><span><span><span><span><span>（此项承诺格式自拟，附在商务部分“其他材料”）</span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.招标人保留对投标文件进行复核的权利，如果发现投标人在招投标过程中提供虚假材料信息、串通投标、弄虚作假等违法行为的，其投标保证金将不予退还，对于给招标人造成损失，超过投标保证金金额的，招标人有权向投标人追偿损失，已中标的取消其中标资格并报建设行政主管部门进行备案作不良记录向社会公布,投标人须承诺投标文件的真实性，如果发现有弄虚作假的行为，由此引起的一切法律责任和后果均由投标人自行负责</span></span></span></span></span><b><span><span><span><span><span>（此项需自行承诺，格式自拟，附在商务部分“其他材料”）。</span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.中标单位需在中标通知书发出后30个工作日内，到招标人处签订合同，中标单位各项目负责人本人需到招标人处登记备案，未按要求签订合同和登记备案的将视为自愿放弃中标，其投标保证金将不予退还，招标人可以确定下一中标候选人（按中标候选人顺序依次类推）中标，也可以重新招标，并报送建设行政主管部门备案。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4.投标人须承诺按招标人提供的工程量清单编制投标报价，未更改项目编码、项目名称、项目特征、计量单位、工程量等，招标人有权按有利于招标人的方式对已标价工程量清单进行复核，如投标人多计的不予计算，少计的视为已包括在已标价工程量清单其他项目中</span></span></span></span></span><b><span><span><span><span><span>（此项需自行承诺，格式自拟，附在商务部分“其他材料”）</span></span></span></span></span></b><span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>5.中标人在领取中标通知书时需无偿提供纸质投标文件。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>6.修改1.4.3条</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>近三年内是指</span></span></span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>近三年应为2023年05月至2026年05月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7.如交易中心软件系统里投标文件的格式及排序与招标文件文本里投标文件的格式及排序不一致时，以系统为准。对投标文件的格式及排序不作强制要求，投标人的投标文件只需具备招标文件要求的内容即可。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.投标人须承诺具备完成本项目的履约能力，在规定的工期内保质、保量的完成该项目所有工作，施工的内容以招标人下达的任务书为准。</span></span></span></span><b><span><span><span><span><span>（此项承诺格式自拟，附在商务部分“其他材料”）</span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.招标人保留对投标文件进行复核的权利，如果发现投标人在招投标过程中提供虚假材料信息、串通投标、弄虚作假等违法行为的，其投标保证金将不予退还，对于给招标人造成损失，超过投标保证金金额的，招标人有权向投标人追偿损失，已中标的取消其中标资格并报建设行政主管部门进行备案作不良记录向社会公布,投标人须承诺投标文件的真实性，如果发现有弄虚作假的行为，由此引起的一切法律责任和后果均由投标人自行负责</span></span></span></span></span><b><span><span><span><span><span>（此项需自行承诺，格式自拟，附在商务部分“其他材料”）。</span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.中标单位需在中标通知书发出后30个工作日内，到招标人处签订合同，中标单位各项目负责人本人需到招标人处登记备案，未按要求签订合同和登记备案的将视为自愿放弃中标，其投标保证金将不予退还，招标人可以确定下一中标候选人（按中标候选人顺序依次类推）中标，也可以重新招标，并报送建设行政主管部门备案。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4.投标人须承诺按招标人提供的工程量清单编制投标报价，未更改项目编码、项目名称、项目特征、计量单位、工程量等，招标人有权按有利于招标人的方式对已标价工程量清单进行复核，如投标人多计的不予计算，少计的视为已包括在已标价工程量清单其他项目中</span></span></span></span></span><b><span><span><span><span><span>（此项需自行承诺，格式自拟，附在商务部分“其他材料”）</span></span></span></span></span></b><span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>5.中标人在领取中标通知书时需无偿提供纸质投标文件。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>6.修改1.4.3条</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>近三年内是指</span></span></span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>近三年应为2023年05月至2026年05月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7.如交易中心软件系统里投标文件的格式及排序与招标文件文本里投标文件的格式及排序不一致时，以系统为准。对投标文件的格式及排序不作强制要求，投标人的投标文件只需具备招标文件要求的内容即可。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>", "html": "", "method": "更正公告", "region": "贵州", "buyer": "六枝特区2026年中央水利发展资金", "deadline": "", "budget": "", "attachments": [{"url": "https://ggzy.guizhou.gov.cn/hallweb/hall/attach/nosession/download?attachId=5ced2df7-7ca0-4656-8d29-055af9cc05ea", "name": "download", "ext": "download", "local_file": "93906_download"}, {"url": "https://ggzy.guizhou.gov.cn/hallweb/hall/attach/nosession/download?attachId=4402f6ac-2c35-4547-9f33-4c533029fffa", "name": "download", "ext": "download", "local_file": "93906_download"}, {"url": "https://ggzy.guizhou.gov.cn/hallweb/hall/attach/nosession/download?attachId=032ca8f6-a14d-4ceb-a7fc-2c0c0a9a8c4f", "name": "download", "ext": "download", "local_file": "93906_download"}, {"url": "https://ggzy.guizhou.gov.cn/hallweb/hall/attach/nos